{"id":"n62370-2-11","stage":2,"title":"비키다 · 让开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62370-2-11-1","ko":"길 앞에다 차를 세워 두면 어떻게 합니까?","zh":"怎么能把车停在路口挡着呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길","meaning":"路，道，道路","explanation":"길：路，道，道路","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"1","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에다","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에다：表示放置、添加或作用的位置；相当于强调的 에。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세워","meaning":"竖，立","explanation":"세우다：竖，立；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"11","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두면","meaning":"放，处于，在","explanation":"두다：放，处于，在；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"2","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합니까?","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，道，道路","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"供人或车等通行的，以一定宽度延伸的长长的地面上空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"竖，立","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"固定在地上，使其垂直站立。","pronunciation":["세우다"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"放，处于，在","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"置于某种状况或状态之中。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e42960db992e0d2e9a62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62370-2-11-2","ko":"금방 차 비켜 드릴게요.","zh":"我马上把车挪开。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立马","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"2","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비켜","meaning":"让开，回避","explanation":"비키다：让开，回避；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비키다","audio":"/audio/bcd25b28e527e71363e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62370","senseId":"2","lemma":"비키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"致，呈，献，奉上","explanation":"드리다：致，呈，献，奉上；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"就现在，立刻。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"bcd25b28e527e713","term":"비키다","zh":"让开，回避","audio":"/audio/bcd25b28e527e71363e8.mp3","entryId":"62370","definition":"为不碰面或不撞到而稍稍改变方向。","pronunciation":["비ː키다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，呈，献，奉上","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"(尊称)给。","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f13af7c7cfb2c0faa1b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62370","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":84,"sequenceScore":2.3367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["怎么能把车停在路口挡着呢？","我马上把车挪开。","昨晚看到半月了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["怎么能把车停在路口挡着呢？","我马上把车挪开。","昨晚看到半月了。"],"answer":1}]}
